// (src/data/collective-evidence.ts), so section references live there, not
// here. Content bands are light and set in 18px text; the styles at the foot
// scope that to this page through .tc. Music has its own page,
// /resources/music-dsp/. Text with links is HTML and goes through set:html;
// the URLs are in SRC.
